; correction_demo.dat — TraceWin-parity orbit-correction demo
;
; 6 FODO cells of (QF, QD) at 5 MeV proton.  Four steerer + BPM pairs
; placed every other cell, each preceded by an ADJUST_STEERER card.
; Initial steerer kicks are zero; with a perfectly-aligned lattice the
; orbit is straight and the corrector finds zero kicks.  Plant
; misalignments on the quadrupoles (via the Python demo script) and the
; corrector recovers a flat orbit using only the four BPMs.
;
; Length: ~3.5 m.  Quadrupole gradient 8 T/m is well-matched to a 50 mm
; quad and 5 MeV proton (βρ ≈ 0.32 T·m).
;
TITLE Orbit correction demo (TraceWin parity, 6-cell FODO)
FREQ 352.21
;
; ── Cell 1 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DRIFT 100 30
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 50 30
ADJUST_STEERER 1 0.02 1e-4
THIN_STEERING 0.0 0.0 30 0
DRIFT 50 30
DIAG_POSITION
DRIFT 100 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
; ── Cell 2 (no steerer/BPM) ───────────────────────────────────────────
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 250 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
; ── Cell 3 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 50 30
ADJUST_STEERER 2 0.02 1e-4
THIN_STEERING 0.0 0.0 30 0
DRIFT 50 30
DIAG_POSITION
DRIFT 100 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
; ── Cell 4 (no steerer/BPM) ───────────────────────────────────────────
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 250 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
; ── Cell 5 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 50 30
ADJUST_STEERER 3 0.02 1e-4
THIN_STEERING 0.0 0.0 30 0
DRIFT 50 30
DIAG_POSITION
DRIFT 100 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
; ── Cell 6 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
QUAD 100 8 20
DRIFT 50 30
ADJUST_STEERER 4 0.02 1e-4
THIN_STEERING 0.0 0.0 30 0
DRIFT 50 30
DIAG_POSITION
DRIFT 100 30
QUAD 100 -8 20
DRIFT 100 30
;
END
